    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Findings vary and can be intermittent: sinus brady, ⍉respiratory sinus arrhythmia, SA exit block, sinus arrest (pause > 3 seconds), A-fib w a slow ventricular response, or bradycardia–tachycardia syndrome."
     }
    ]
   },
