       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Intrinsic:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " idiopathic degen fibrosis (MC), ischemia, cardiomyopathies, infiltrative dz (sarcoidosis, hemochromatosis), congenital abnormalities"
     }
    ]
   },
